+## [Unreleased]
+
+### Added
+
+- `Registry::transaction()` and `Transaction`: stage inserts, then apply
+  them together with `commit` or discard them by dropping. Each
+  `Transaction::add_transform` runs the checks `Registry::add_transform`
+  would run against the registry plus what is already staged, and a
+  rejected transform is not staged, so the caller attributes errors per
+  item and chooses the policy: `?` and drop for all-or-nothing, or
+  ignore the error to skip the item. The accepted sequence commits to
+  exactly the state of the `add_transform` loop.
+
 ## [2.2.0] - 2026-09-27
 
 ### Added
